## Adding a feature

Follow `.cursor/skills/add-feature-web/SKILL.md` step-by-step.
Always run `npm run build` to verify before finishing.

## Key conventions

- API calls go through `src/api/client.ts` (axios, auto-unwraps `{data}` envelope).
- Auth state in `useAuthStore` (Zustand persist). Home (`/`) is public by default.
- Wrap routes in `<ProtectedRoute />` when a feature requires sign-in.
- Pages (`src/pages/`) are thin wrappers; logic lives in `src/features/`.
- Use only components from the project's design system — see `design-system.mdc`.

## Verification

```bash
npm run build   # must pass before any PR
npm run dev     # local dev on http://localhost:5173
```
